    "body":  "## Final exact-head acceptance — `d754d9aa948cbee086354fb2bc70b3f7f1f0deef`\n\n**6/6 PASS:** [PR Verify](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687604), [IDE Host](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687578), [Theia Browser Host](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687570), [Browser-Only](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687689), [Pages build + Chromium](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687574), [Published Interface ZIP parity](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions/runs/45379687603). This is a PR build, not a production deployment.\n\nReal browser-only Chromium markers:\n- `STUDIO_EXAMPLE_PINNED_INTERFACE_READY_CHROMIUM`: `READY`, `imported:true`, `lockedDependencyCount:1`, `availableCompletionCallables:11`, `contextReadHint:true`, `AUTH_NOT_CHECKED`.\n- `STUDIO_LEGACY_EXAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_CHROMIUM_PASS`: cancelling keeps the legacy Example unchanged; confirming restores all 4 v1alpha5 Skills and removes retired `lib/` and `output/`. The active `.vscode/settings.json` now survives the cleanup phase and is only rewritten if changed, after all Skills and immutable snapshots are restored.\n- Native Package Explorer displays `ca-client` / `urn:wtlab:ca-client-tools:openamsm-sbi-interface@1.1.0` / `SNAPSHOT_VERIFIED` / `Compiler NOT_LINKED`.\n\n## Goal\n\nDefault **Example** project includes the real, immutable `ca-client-tools v1.1.0` `connectionagent.io/interface-package/v1alpha1` under dependency alias **`ca-client`**, without GitHub/CORS/network access at runtime. Normal projects are untouched. This is an editor-only dependency: `SNAPSHOT_VERIFIED`, `Compiler NOT_LINKED`, `AUTH_NOT_CHECKED`.\n\n## Implementation\n\n- Check in the **exact 4,289-byte public release asset** as a small base64 resource, SHA-256 `cbd8fad939844cda5474f33f18d3cdc015c69dd8c1dc3908e84bd5273ce6e71b`, originating from `odango-chan/ca-client-tools@v1.1.0`. Source bundle step verifies the archive digest/encoding before publishing extension assets. Release-specific CI **downloads the independent actual published ZIP and checks byte-for-byte equality** with the bundled resource.\n- Example seeding **verifies release ZIP before any destructive Example replacement**, decodes the formal immutable 7-file Interface Package, checks published identity/17 exports, writes an existing Dependency Service v0.1 immutable snapshot, then creates `.vscode/settings.json` with a single `ca-client` declaration and exact lock digest. No legacy parser, custom highlighter, mutable URL or synthetic Owner grant.\n- Previously open **current-language Example** instances missing settings are upgraded once with only this default dependency, preserving all authored source files. Existing `.vscode/settings.json` (including explicit dependency removals) is not overwritten. Legacy Example and all other workspaces are excluded. Full Example replacement retains its existing explicit user confirmation.\n- The original four CA-SL v1alpha5 Skill source files stay untouched and pinned to `ca-skills`; README describes what published READ/query interfaces are and are not qualified.\n\n## Tests and qualification\n\n- Unit regression: bundled ZIP SHA, formal Interface decode, existing Schema hints for `ca-client::openamsm.smf.mas.sc.query` (`supi` / `pduSessionId`), immutable snapshot verification, non-replacing reload preservation, safe existing Example migration, stale Example exclusion, user settings preservation and fail-before-writes for corrupt package.\n- Real Theia Chromium acceptance must confirm Package Explorer `ca-client` row, `SNAPSHOT_VERIFIED` and `Compiler NOT_LINKED`, plus callable Schema completions, alongside native Source+Preview, four Skill inventory and original tests.\n- Do not claim Compiler v2.1.0 linking/Owner Authorization, Build PASS, Runtime admission or real 5GC qualification; compiler follow-up remains #269.\n\nThe temporary CI-only base64 printing step has been removed; final workflow only checks equality against the real published release.\n\n**Final exact-head gates:** [Actions](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-skill-studio-demo/actions) — pending merge until all pass.",
